// reject: E-NAM-001 (at the marked line)
// covers: LANG-04-06
// A module checked on its own is the entry module of an implicit one-module application: its `main` is the entry
// point and must have one of the four forms of 4.6 (D-51.2). A `pure` main is none of them. (`main()` with no
// parameters is one since X-345: ent_main_no_params.ft.)
pure func main() {              // reject: E-NAM-001 — not one of the four forms of 4.6
}
